3. Hierarchical Control Architecture
This section presents a hierarchical control architecture for autonomous trajectory tracking, composed of an outer MPC loop for trajectory tracking and an inner loop implemented by EMFC. The EMFC itself features two cascaded sub-loops: an outer loop responsible for following translational velocity and yaw rate commands, and an inner loop


